   "data": {
    "title": "My November Novel · 50,000 words",
    "content": "<h2>50,000 words · 30 days · 1–30 November</h2><p>That is about <strong>1,667 words a day</strong>, roughly 40 to 90 minutes of writing. This board is your planning desk and your scoreboard: plan a little, then write a lot.</p><h3>How to use it</h3><ul><li>Before 1 November: fill in [[Premise]], [[Characters]] and [[World & Setting]]. Twenty minutes each is plenty.</li><li>Sketch the [[Plot]] with seven beats, then spread them over four weeks in the [[Scene list]].</li><li>Every day: write, then tick your day in the [[Daily tracker]].</li><li>Keep the [[Rules for November]] in sight. When you get stuck, open [[Stuck? Prompts]].</li><li>On 1 December: [[After November]].</li></ul><p>Click any card, press D to open the full editor, and type straight into the empty lines.</p>",
    "attachments": [],
    "shape": "sun",
    "color": "#FDE68A",
    "backgroundColor": "#FDE68A",
    "textColor": "#1E293B",
    "contentMode": "standard",
    "checklistItems": []
   }
  },
