   },
   "data": {
    "title": "One-line pitch",
    "content": "<p>Who is it about, what do they want, and what stands in the way? Aim for one sentence you could say in an elevator.</p><p><em>Example shape: When [event] happens, [hero] must [goal] before [deadline], or else [stakes].</em></p><p><strong>My version:</strong> </p><p></p>",
    "attachments": [],
    "shape": "rounded",
    "color": "#FCD34D",
    "backgroundColor": "#FCD34D",
    "textColor": "#1E293B",
    "contentMode": "standard",
