   "data": {
    "title": "Genre & tone",
    "content": "<p>Pick a genre and a mood: cosy mystery, dark fantasy, quiet literary, fast thriller, romcom... Two words are enough.</p><p><strong>Genre:</strong> </p><p><strong>Tone:</strong> </p><p><strong>Working title:</strong> </p>",
