   },
   "data": {
    "title": "What if…?",
    "content": "<ul><li>What if the only person who can stop the disaster is the one who caused it?</li><li>What if every clock in town showed a different time?</li><li>What if you inherited a debt that can only be paid with a secret?</li><li>What if the villain were right about one thing?</li><li>What if the quietest person in the room is the only honest one?</li></ul><p><strong>My own what-if:</strong> </p>",
    "attachments": [],
    "shape": "rounded",
    "color": "#FCD34D",
    "backgroundColor": "#FCD34D",
    "textColor": "#1E293B",
    "contentMode": "standard",
