   "data": {
    "title": "Stakes",
    "content": "<p>What does your hero lose if they fail? Make it personal first, then big. Readers keep turning pages for what could be lost.</p><p><strong>If they fail, they lose:</strong> </p><p><strong>The ticking clock:</strong> </p>",
