   },
   "data": {
    "title": "Antagonist",
    "content": "<p>The force that blocks the hero. Give them a reason that makes sense from their side; the best villains believe they are right.</p><p><strong>Name:</strong> </p><p><strong>Age & look:</strong> </p><p><strong>Want (what they chase):</strong> </p><p><strong>Need (what they truly lack):</strong> </p><p><strong>Flaw (what trips them):</strong> </p><p><strong>Secret:</strong> </p>",
