   "data": {
    "title": "Ally",
    "content": "<p>A friend, mentor or sidekick who helps, doubts or tells the hero the truth. Allies can have their own want too.</p><p><strong>Name:</strong> </p><p><strong>Age & look:</strong> </p><p><strong>Want (what they chase):</strong> </p><p><strong>Need (what they truly lack):</strong> </p><p><strong>Flaw (what trips them):</strong> </p><p><strong>Secret:</strong> </p>",
