    "content": "<p>Small details make people feel real. Give each main character one habit, one phrase they repeat and one thing they never talk about.</p><p><strong>Habit:</strong> </p><p><strong>Catchphrase:</strong> </p><p><strong>Never speaks of:</strong> </p>",
