   "data": {
    "title": "Stuck on a scene",
    "content": "<ol start=\"1\"><li>Start with the last thing a character says, then write backwards.</li><li>Skip ahead: write the scene that comes after the one blocking you.</li></ol><p><em>Pick one and write for 10 minutes.</em></p>",
