   "data": {
    "title": "Stuck on a character",
    "content": "<ol start=\"3\"><li>Interview your hero: what are they hiding from their best friend?</li><li>Let the antagonist narrate one page in their own voice.</li></ol><p><em>Pick one and write for 10 minutes.</em></p>",
