   "data": {
    "title": "After November",
    "content": "<p>The draft is not the book. What to do on 1 December and after.</p><ul><li>[[1 · Rest]]</li><li>[[2 · Read, don't fix]]</li><li>[[3 · Revise in layers]]</li><li>[[4 · Share & celebrate]]</li></ul>",
    "attachments": [],
