    "title": "Plot",
    "content": "<p>Seven beats of a classic story. Fill the \"My version\" lines in any order.</p><ul><li>[[1 · Hook]]</li><li>[[2 · Inciting incident]]</li><li>[[3 · First plot point]]</li><li>[[4 · Midpoint]]</li><li>[[5 · Crisis]]</li><li>[[6 · Climax]]</li><li>[[7 · Resolution]]</li></ul>",
