   "data": {
    "title": "1 · Hook",
    "content": "<p><strong>Days 1–2 (words 1–3,300)</strong></p><p>Open on a moment that makes the reader curious: a strange image, a question, a voice. Show your hero in their ordinary world, with a hint that it will not last.</p><p><strong>My version:</strong> </p><p></p>",
