   "data": {
    "title": "2 · Inciting incident",
    "content": "<p><strong>Around Day 4 (word 6,000)</strong></p><p>The event that knocks the hero's world off balance. Something arrives, breaks or is revealed, and a question starts that the book must answer.</p><p><strong>My version:</strong> </p><p></p>",
