    "title": "3 · First plot point",
    "content": "<p><strong>Around Day 8 (word 12,500)</strong></p><p>The hero commits and cannot go back. End of the first act: they leave the ordinary world for the story's real problem.</p><p><strong>My version:</strong> </p><p></p>",
