    "title": "4 · Midpoint",
    "content": "<p><strong>Around Day 15 (word 25,000)</strong></p><p>A twist or a discovery that flips the story: the hero stops reacting and starts acting, or learns the problem is bigger than they thought.</p><p><strong>My version:</strong> </p><p></p>",
