    "title": "5 · Crisis",
    "content": "<p><strong>Around Day 23 (word 37,500)</strong></p><p>The lowest point. The plan fails, someone is lost, the hero sees their flaw. It should feel as if all is lost, so the climax can feel earned.</p><p><strong>My version:</strong> </p><p></p>",
