    "title": "7 · Resolution",
    "content": "<p><strong>Days 28–30 (words 46,700–50,000)</strong></p><p>Show the new normal. Tie the loose threads and echo the opening so the reader sees how far the hero has come. You may stop mid-story: 50,000 words is a draft, not an ending.</p><p><strong>My version:</strong> </p><p></p>",
